{"seq":2,"slug":"crosstalk-emi","title":"串扰与电磁干扰","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crosstalk-mechanisms","title":"串扰机理与耦合模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/crosstalk-mechanisms","wordCount":1908,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"emi-sources-paths","title":"EMI 源与传播路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/emi-sources-paths","wordCount":2257,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"shielding-filtering-design","title":"屏蔽与滤波设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/signal-integrity/crosstalk-emi/shielding-filtering-design","wordCount":2237,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"串扰与电磁干扰\">串扰与电磁干扰</h1><p>串扰（Crosstalk）和电磁干扰（EMI）是高速 PCB 设计中信号完整性退化的两大外部因素。串扰源于相邻走线间的电磁耦合，EMI 则涉及系统内部和外部的电磁能量非预期传播。本章从耦合机理出发，分析近端串扰与远端串扰的物理本质，探讨 EMI 产生的根源和传播路径，并给出实用的屏蔽与滤波设计方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心主题\">核心主题</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>内容方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>串扰机理与耦合模型</td>\n<td>容性耦合与感性耦合、NEXT/FEXT、3W规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EMI源与传播路径</td>\n<td>共模辐射、差模辐射、接地回路、电源噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏蔽与滤波设计</td>\n<td>屏蔽效能计算、EMI滤波器、PCB级EMC设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习目标\">学习目标</h2><ul>\n<li>理解串扰的物理机制及其与频率、间距的关系</li>\n<li>掌握 NEXT/FEXT 的定量分析方法</li>\n<li>识别 PCB 设计中常见的 EMI 辐射源</li>\n<li>能够运用屏蔽和滤波技术进行 EMC 设计</li>\n</ul>\n"}